{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenebris Legion merges the immersive narrative of a visual novel with the exploratory freedom of an adventure game. 1988. New England. An FBI agent in training searches for his missing father. What he discovers is an ancient war between supernatural forces that will test the limits of his reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/4e769ee0c65c9855c3e8ec7dc1c092f6.poster.avif?t=1772968786\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/4e769ee0c65c9855c3e8ec7dc1c092f6.webm?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/4e769ee0c65c9855c3e8ec7dc1c092f6.mp4?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTHING IS WHAT IT SEEMS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/a12d71360a5e176ba90efcbcce4a7380.poster.avif?t=1772968786\" width=1000 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/a12d71360a5e176ba90efcbcce4a7380.webm?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/a12d71360a5e176ba90efcbcce4a7380.mp4?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mother and her two daughters welcome you to their home. But nothing is what it seems. Unveil their secrets and discover what lies behind your father's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY ARE IN CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/095b0b7c897046eb778035d59055e7e1.poster.avif?t=1772968786\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/095b0b7c897046eb778035d59055e7e1.webm?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/095b0b7c897046eb778035d59055e7e1.mp4?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enigmatic women, forbidden places, and a plot where every answer generates new questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, SOLVE, DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/e794613f669f4a65aee79e2eb169b55d.poster.avif?t=1772968786\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/e794613f669f4a65aee79e2eb169b55d.webm?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/e794613f669f4a65aee79e2eb169b55d.mp4?t=1772968786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, investigate every corner, and make decisions that will shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULLY ANIMATED SCENES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/9cc3a4b8521ba2effe35520b53acd572.poster.avif?t=1772968786\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st